</div></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="1-5rem" class="spacer w-variant-a321f877-8764-0427-5411-6988708cfd05"></div><div data-wf--re-plain-text--variant="18px" STYLE="font-weight:500; margin-bottom:0.5rem" class="plain-text-component w-variant-02420c93-9a41-6c6e-89b8-92a2e35d1d5b"><div data-wf--re-plain-text-color--variant="base-color" class="plain-text-color"><div>Scan for malware</div></div></div><div data-wf--re-plain-text--variant="14px" class="plain-text-component w-variant-21c22b07-aa00-a1e3-f6d3-2bcb1c711373"><div data-wf--re-plain-text-color--variant="base-color" class="plain-text-color"><div>Secure your code, cloud, and runtime in one central system. Find and fix vulnerabilities fast automatically.</div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="1-5rem" class="spacer w-variant-a321f877-8764-0427-5411-6988708cfd05"></div><a data-wf--button-tertiary-new--variant="no-gradient" data-wf-native-id-path="ff761fe4-e434-3f98-6318-f372db17bf19:b4b634b4-45ff-aec7-0b7a-5e6645a1fbad" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b4b634b4-45ff-aec7-0b7a-5e6645a1fbad" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22b4b634b4-45ff-aec7-0b7a-5e6645a1fbad%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22ff761fe4-e434-3f98-6318-f372db17bf19%22%7D%5D" href="https://app.aikido.dev/" class="u-button-tretiary w-variant-ecd13c72-df41-6bc3-4f1f-5992b357cf23 w-inline-block"><div class="button_tretiary_text w-variant-ecd13c72-df41-6bc3-4f1f-5992b357cf23">Start for free</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 20" fill="none" class="button_tretiary_arrow w-variant-ecd13c72-df41-6bc3-4f1f-5992b357cf23"><path d="M15.9417 9.55833C16.0581 9.67584 16.1234 9.83457 16.1234 10C16.1234 10.1654 16.0581 10.3242 15.9417 10.4417L11.775 14.6083C11.7178 14.6697 11.6488 14.719 11.5721 14.7531C11.4954 14.7873 11.4127 14.8057 11.3288 14.8072C11.2448 14.8086 11.1615 14.7932 11.0837 14.7618C11.0058 14.7303 10.9351 14.6835 10.8758 14.6242C10.8164 14.5648 10.7697 14.4