-2bcb1c711373"><div data-wf--re-plain-text-color--variant="neutral-500" class="plain-text-color w-variant-960a0f75-2e42-d9be-f97a-bf0a0dd5f949"><div>November 13, 2026</div></div></div><h3 STYLE="margin-bottom:1rem; font-size:1.5rem" class="heading-component"><span>Critical Apache HTTP Server vulnerability can allow remote code execution (CVE-2026-119618)</span></h3><div data-wf--re-plain-text--variant="16px" STYLE="margin-bottom:1rem" class="plain-text-component text-style-3lines"><div data-wf--re-plain-text-color--variant="base-color" class="plain-text-color"><div>A critical race condition in Apache HTTP Server’s HTTP/2 module lets a remote attacker run code with no credentials. Upgrade to 2.4.71, or turn off HTTP/2 if you can’t patch yet.</div></div></div><a data-wf--button-tertiary-new--variant="black" data-wf-native-id-path="013ade1e-2f66-78a8-ea72-e1e789a143fc_instance-1:b4b634b4-45ff-aec7-0b7a-5e6645a1fbad_instance-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b4b634b4-45ff-aec7-0b7a-5e6645a1fbad" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265f2e16478f0b82120e5cccb%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226af6d0312d891bfc0fbac925%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22b4b634b4-45ff-aec7-0b7a-5e6645a1fbad%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22013ade1e-2f66-78a8-ea72-e1e789a143fc%22%7D%5D" href="/blog/cve-2026-119618-apache-http-server-rce" class="u-button-tretiary w-variant-153e1cf3-d221-a28e-167e-67f75ea6502d w-inline-block"><div class="button_tretiary_text w-variant-153e1cf3-d221-a28e-167e-67f75ea6502d">Read more</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 20" fill="none" class="button_tretiary_arrow w-variant-153e1cf3-d221-a28e-167e-67f75ea6502d"><path d="M15.9417 9.55833C16.0581 9.67584 16.1234 9.83457 16.1234 10C16.1234 10.1654 16.0581 10.3242 15.9417 10.4417L11.775 14.6083C11.7178 14.6697 11.6488 14.719 11.5721 14.7531C11.4954 14.7873 11.4127 14.8057 11.3288 14.8072C11.2448 14.8086 11.1615 14.7932 11.0837 14.7618C11.0058 14.7303 10.9351 14.6835 10.8758 14.6242C10.8164 14.5648 10.7697 14.4942 10.7382 14.4163C10.7068 14.3385 10.6913 14.2551 10.6928 14.1712C10.6943 14.0873 10.7127 14.0045 10.7468 13.9279C10.781 13.8512 10.8302 13.7822 10.8917 13.725L13.9917 10.625L5.49999 10.625C5.33423 10.625 5.17526 10.5592 5.05805 10.4419C4.94084 10.3247 4.87499 10.1658 4.87499 10C4.87499 9.83424 4.94084 9.67527 5.05805 9.55806C5.17526 9.44085 5.33423 9.375 5.49999 9.375L13.9917 9.375L10.8917 6.275C10.7813 6.15652 10.7212 5.99981 10.724 5.8379C10.7269 5.67598 10.7925 5.52149 10.907 5.40698C11.0215 5.29247 11.176 5.22688 11.3379 5.22402C11.4998 5.22116 11.6565 5.28127 11.775 5.39167L15.9417 9.55833Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="blog-posts_item w-dyn-item"><div class="blog-posts_post"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642adcaf364024654c71df23/6af53377bf6dde907dc1592a_GitHub_Feature.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642adcaf364024654c71df23/6af53377bf6dde907dc1592a_GitHub_Feature-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642adcaf364024654c71df23/6af53377bf6dde907dc1592a_GitHub_Feature-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642adcaf364024654c71df23/6af53377bf6dde907dc1592a_GitHub_Feature-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642adcaf364024654c71df23/6af53377bf6dde907dc1592a_GitHub_Feature-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642adcaf364024654c71df23/6af53377bf6dde907dc1592a_GitHub_Feature.jpg 1920w" class="blog-post_img"/><div class="blog-post_content"><div data-wf--re-plain-text--variant="14px" STYLE="margin-bottom:0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;" class="plain-text-component w-variant-21c22b07-aa00-a1e3-f6d3-2bcb1c711373"><div data-wf--re-plain-text-color--variant="neutral-500" class="plain-text-color w-variant-960a0f75-2e42-d9be-f97a-bf0a0dd5f949"><div>November 12, 2026</div></div></div><h3 STYLE="margin-bottom: